      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "旺紫丁顺利完成出道战平安归来。\n虽说是比赛刚结束，\n但她的身心看上去都很充实……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1d4e279c008bd6adff4be00ad334789d9c32d4c1bde40295532ebdbf9f69875",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
