    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:717d743e917cea772fd7a1fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "作为训练员，要持续不断地去思考。\n思考怎样才能让她走上明星之路，\n思考如何让她成长得更快、更茁壮――",
      "source_fingerprint": "24504b59b4c2a9aa482703b033bc2b7a89052812db24bb6650ffd114f2feaedb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
